    <div class="page-intro">
        <h1>🛡️ Passing</h1>
        <p>Volleyball Academy • Learn, train and improve</p>
        <a class="back-home" href="index.html">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
    <section id="passing">
<h2>🛡️ Passing</h2>
<p class="subtitle">
        A good pass gives your setter options.
    </p>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h3>Platform</h3>
<p>
                Put your arms together to create a flat platform.
                Keep your shoulders facing your target.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Move Your Feet</h3>
<p>
                Don't reach for the ball if you can move your body
                underneath it. Get your platform behind the ball.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Control</h3>
<p>
                Use your legs and body position to control the ball.
                Avoid wildly swinging your arms.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
<p>🏐 Volleyball Academy</p>
<p>Learn • Train • Improve</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
